Package: maluos-branding
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MaluOS identity: os-release, issue and message of the day
 Diverts /usr/lib/os-release and writes /etc/issue and /etc/issue.net,
 so base-files upgrades keep working. os-release keeps
 ID=ubuntu and ID_LIKE=debian for tool compatibility (cloud-init,
 curtin, apt-add-repository, PGDG); NAME, PRETTY_NAME and VARIANT say
 MaluOS. Also ships /etc/maluos-release and a short motd banner.
